<v Orlando>And so you're going to hear no, no, and no.

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:33.712
<v Orlando>And as you listen to it,

00:01:33.712 --> 00:01:39.250
<v Orlando>you'll hear that it just doesn't sound like Spanish
